 3. ⚡️ Catch me up 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Argentina's Leandro Paredes gets violent with Spain's Gavi after last month's FIFA World Cup Final. Photo: Marvin Ibo Guengoer - GES Sportfoto/Getty Images ⚽️ FIFA has banned three Argentina players, including a 10-match suspension for midfielder Leandro Paredes, for striking their Spanish opponents after losing the World Cup final. Go deeper . 📚 The FTC is being urged to investigate AI companies for buying, scanning and destroying books to train their models, per a letter first shared with Axios' Ashley Gold. Go deeper . 📺 A super PAC linked to Sen. Ted Cruz is launching a more than $1.7 million ad campaign to boost Republican Senate nominee Ken Paxton, Axios' Stef W. Kight has learned. Go deeper . 🛒 SNAP food aid enrollment dropped by more than 13% in a 12-month span. That's a far steeper decline than the government estimated as work requirements and other parts of President Trump's "big beautiful bill" take effect. Go deeper . 
 
